APPROVED BY COUNCIL NOVEMBER 26, 2020

The City is considering a Development Variance Permit application to permit phased development with variances for site area and parking at completion of phase 1.

The Zoning Regulation Bylaw R-81 Zone, Speed and Frances Multiple Dwelling District, is varied or supplemented as follows: 
•	reduce the site area of proposed strata lot 1 from 5340m² to 2112m²;
•	reduce the site area of proposed strata lot 2 from 5340m² to 3237m²;
•	reduce the required number of residential parking spaces from 65 to 16 for strata lot 1;
•	reduce the required number of visitor parking spaces from 7 to 4 for strata lot 1.

